Subject: [PATCH] data: propagate stop to graphical-session.target

COSMIC logout stops cosmic-session.target but leaves
graphical-session.target active. xdg-desktop-portal is
PartOf=graphical-session.target, so it survives with the COSMIC
environment and keeps selecting the COSMIC backend in the next
KDE session. Propagate the stop so the session target is torn down.

--- a/data/cosmic-session.target
+++ b/data/cosmic-session.target
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@
 
 BindsTo=graphical-session.target
 Before=graphical-session.target
+PropagatesStopTo=graphical-session.target
 
 Wants=graphical-session-pre.target
 After=graphical-session-pre.target
